WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.930
The newest actor to step into the Spidey suit,
Tom Holland made his Marvel Cinematic Universe

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:09.880
debut in 2016's Captain America: Civil War,
then basked in the solo spotlight for his

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.920
own film, Spider-Man: Homecoming, a year later.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.720
Holland has since burst into the mainstream,
established himself as a (still quite young)

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:21.580
A-list actor, and proven his iteration of
Spider-Man to be an integral part of the MCU,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.199
including 2018's Avengers: Infinity War.

00:00:24.199 --> 00:00:27.929
Despite his Marvel movie experience, however,
Holland had trouble keeping it together on

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:31.529
the Infinity War set, finding it difficult
to work with a fellow actor.

00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:35.360
Speaking with Hey U Guys, Holland revealed
that he actually had trouble acting opposite

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:39.740
Chris Pratt, known in the MCU for his Guardians
of the Galaxy franchise character:

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.180
"Star Lord."

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.180
"Who?"

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.080
"Star Lord, man.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.200
Legendary outlaw."

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.190
But don't worry about prima donna drama on
the set of Infinity War, the reason for Holland's

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.370
strife is actually pretty darn adorable.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.870
Speaking of Pratt, Holland said:

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:59.580
"He is so funny, he's so fun, and he has such
great stories about his career and about the

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.020
industry, and he's also just super talented."

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.700
But it wasn't being in awe of Pratt's sheer
talent that gave Holland trouble.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.490
Pratt was simply too funny, and Holland couldn't
be around him without folding over in a fit

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.490
of laughter.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.740
"I found it quite difficult because he would
make me laugh so much.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.100
You know?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.250
He's the man.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.250
I absolutely love him."

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:21.609
Not that anyone ever doubted it, but it seems
the Guardians actor is just as goofy and fun-loving

00:01:21.609 --> 00:01:24.350
when the cameras stop rolling as Marvel fans
would hope.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.220
We can imagine that with Chris Pratt being
Chris Pratt, it must have been hard for Holland

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.300
to keep a straight face.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:33.319
Admittedly, though, a 15-year-old kid like
Peter Parker would probably be tickled pink

00:01:33.319 --> 00:01:37.009
in the presence of the silly Star-Lord, so
perhaps some of Holland's smirks that make

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:39.490
it into the film's theatrical cut are completely
genuine.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.920
"He's the new blood, get used to it."

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:42.920
Thanks for watching!

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.409
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:47.560
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

